er><main class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"min-h-screen bg-[var(--neutral-light)]\"><div class=\"bg-[var(--primary)] text-white py-12\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-2\" style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\">Alle Anträge</h1><p class=\"text-[var(--secondary)]\">Durchsuche alle Stadtratsentscheidungen und -anträge</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white border-b sticky top-16 z-40\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"🔍 Suche nach Anträgen...\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[var(--primary)] focus:border-transparent\" value=\"\"/></div><select class=\"px-4 py-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[var(--primary)] bg-white\"><option value=\"alle\" selected=\"\">Alle Kategorien</option><option value=\"verkehr\">🚗<!-- --> <!-- -->Verkehr</option><option value=\"umwelt\">🌱<!-- --> <!-- -->Umwelt &amp; Klima</option><option value=\"soziales\">👨‍👩‍👧‍👦<!-- --> <!-- -->Soziales &amp; Familie</option><option value=\"finanzen\">💰<!-- --> <!-- -->Finanzen</option><option value=\"kultur\">🎭<!-- --> <!-- -->Kultur &amp; Bildung</option><option value=\"bau\">🏗️<!-- --> <!-- -->Bauen &amp; Wohnen</option></select><select class=\"px-4 py-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[var(--primary)] bg-white\"><option value=\"alle\" selected=\"\">Alle Status</option><option value=\"angenommen\">✅ Angenommen</option><option value=\"abgelehnt\">❌ Abgelehnt</option><option value=\"in-beratung\">⏳ In Beratung</option><option value=\"vertagt\">📅 Vertagt</option></select><select class=\"px-4 py-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[var(--primary)] bg-white\"><option value=\"alle\" selected=\"\">Alle Stadtteile</option><option value=\"Altstadt\">📍 <!-- -->Altstadt</option><option value=\"Stadtpark\">📍 <!-- -->Stadtpark</option><option value=\"Nord\">📍 <!-- -->Nord</option><option value=\"Süd\">📍 <!-- -->Süd</option><option value=\"Gewerbegebiet\">📍 <!-- -->Gewerbegebiet</option><option value=\"Aich\">📍 <!-- -->Aich</option></select></div></div></div><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8\"><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--neutral-gray)] mb-6\">4<!-- --> <!-- -->Anträge<!-- --> gefunden</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><a href=\"/antrag/1\"><article class=\"card p-5 hover:scale-[1.02] cursor-pointer h-full flex flex-col\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-lg\" style=\"background-color:#0077B620\">🚗</span><span class=\"text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)]\">Verkehr</span></div><span class=\"badge badge-success\">Angenommen</span></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg mb-2 line-clamp-2\" style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\">Tempo 30 in der Altstadt</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--neutral-gray)] mb-4 line-clamp-2 flex-grow\">Die Geschwindigkeit in der gesamten Altstadt soll auf 30 km/h begrenzt werden, um die Sicherheit für Fußgänger und Radfahrer zu erhöhen.</p><div class=\"mb-4\"><div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)] mb-1\"><span>Dafür: <!-- -->18</span><span>Dagegen: <!-- -->6</span></div><div class=\"h-2 bg-gray-200 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex\"><div class=\"h-full bg-[var(--success)]\" style=\"width:69.23076923076923%\"></div><div class=\"h-full bg-[var(--danger)]\" style=\"width:30.769230769230774%\"></div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)] pt-3 border-t border-gray-100\"><span>📅 <!-- -->15.11.2024</span><span>📍 <!-- -->Altstadt</span><span>💬 <!-- -->2</span></div></article></a><a href=\"/antrag/2\"><article class=\"card p-5 hover:scale-[1.02] cursor-pointer h-full flex flex-col\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-lg\" style=\"background-color:#EF476F20\">👨‍👩‍👧‍👦</span><span class=\"text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)]\">Soziales &amp; Familie</span></div><span class=\"badge badge-success\">Angenommen</span></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg mb-2 line-clamp-2\" style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\">Neuer Spielplatz am Stadtpark</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--neutral-gray)] mb-4 line-clamp-2 flex-grow\">Im Stadtpark soll ein moderner, barrierefreier Spielplatz für Kinder aller Altersgruppen entstehen.</p><div class=\"mb-4\"><div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)] mb-1\"><span>Dafür: <!-- -->24</span><span>Dagegen: <!-- -->0</span></div><div class=\"h-2 bg-gray-200 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex\"><div class=\"h-full bg-[var(--success)]\" style=\"width:92.3076923076923%\"></div><div class=\"h-full bg-[var(--danger)]\" style=\"width:7.692307692307693%\"></div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)] pt-3 border-t border-gray-100\"><span>📅 <!-- -->15.11.2024</span><span>📍 <!-- -->Stadtpark</span><span>💬 <!-- -->1</span></div></article></a><a href=\"/antrag/3\"><article class=\"card p-5 hover:scale-[1.02] cursor-pointer h-full flex flex-col\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-lg\" style=\"background-color:#06D6A020\">🌱</span><span class=\"text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)]\">Umwelt &amp; Klima</span></div><span class=\"badge badge-warning\">In Beratung</span></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg mb-2 line-clamp-2\" style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\">Photovoltaik auf städtischen Gebäuden</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--neutral-gray)] mb-4 line-clamp-2 flex-grow\">Alle geeigneten städtischen Gebäude sollen mit Solaranlagen ausgestattet werden, um die Klimaziele zu erreichen.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)] pt-3 border-t border-gray-100\"><span>📅 <!-- -->15.11.2024</span><span>💬 <!-- -->2</span></div></article></a><a href=\"/antrag/4\"><article class=\"card p-5 hover:scale-[1.02] cursor-pointer h-full flex flex-col\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-lg\" style=\"background-color:#0077B620\">🚗</span><span class=\"text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)]\">Verkehr</span></div><span class=\"badge badge-danger\">Abgelehnt</span></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg mb-2 line-clamp-2\" style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\">Erhöhung der Parkgebühren in der Innenstadt</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--neutral-gray)] mb-4 line-clamp-2 flex-grow\">Die Parkgebühren in der Innenstadt sollen von 1€ auf 1,50€ pro Stunde erhöht werden.</p><div class=\"mb-4\"><div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)] mb-1\"><span>Dafür: <!-- -->8</span><span>Dagegen: <!-- -->16</span></div><div class=\"h-2 bg-gray-200 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex\"><div class=\"h-full bg-[var(--success)]\" style=\"width:30.76923076923077%\"></div><div class=\"h-full bg-[var(--danger)]\" style=\"width:69.23076923076923%\"></div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)] pt-3 border-t border-gray-100\"><span>📅 <!-- -->18.10.2024</span><span>📍 <!-- -->Innenstadt</span><span>💬 <!-- -->2</span></div></article></a></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"bg-[var(--neutral-dark)] text-white mt-auto\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><div class=\"md:col-span-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-[var(--primary)] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"text-white font-bold text-xl\">M</span></div><h2 class=\"font-bold text-lg\" style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\">Moosburg Transparent</h2></div><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Eine Initiative für mehr Transparenz in der Kommunalpolitik. Wir machen Stadtratsentscheidungen verständlich und zugänglich für alle Bürger:innen.</p><p class=\"text-gray-500 text-xs mt-4\">Ein Projekt im Rahmen des Service Design Studiums an der Hochschule München.</p></div><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold mb-4 text-[var(--accent)]\">Navigation</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm\"><li><a class=\"text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Dashboard</a></li><li><a class=\"text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/antraege\">Alle Anträge</a></li><li><a class=\"text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/karte\">Stadtkarte</a></li><li><a class=\"text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/abstimmungen\">Abstimmungen</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold mb-4 text-[var(--accent)]\">Kontakt</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-400\"><li>📧 info@moosburg-transparent.de</li><li>🏛️ Stadt Moosburg a.d. Isar</li><li>📍 Stadtplatz 13, 85368 Moosburg</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"border-t border-gray-700 mt-8 pt-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500\"><p>© 2024 Moosburg Transparent. Alle Rechte vorbehalten.</p><div class=\"flex gap-6\"><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/impressum\">Impressum</a><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/datenschutz\">Datenschutz</a><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/barrierefreiheit\">Barrierefreiheit</a></div></div></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/cbd55ab9639e1e66.js\" id=\"_R_\" 